{"3991200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Momolitos", "steam_appid": 3991200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>MomoLAB</strong>, a mysterious facility where adorable creatures known as <strong>Momolitos</strong> are born!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest researcher, your mission is to explore different zones, collect ingredients, and feed your Momolitos to help them evolve into hundreds of unique forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/97eb9a81fdcc6b2939b21f4882657ee0.poster.avif?t=1776092527\" width=1170 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/97eb9a81fdcc6b2939b21f4882657ee0.webm?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Momolito starts as a simple egg, but your choices determine its path — will it become a joyful and friendly creature, a fierce and wild one, or something totally unexpected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/41648076d0bf839d799eaae96862220d.poster.avif?t=1776092527\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/41648076d0bf839d799eaae96862220d.webm?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/41648076d0bf839d799eaae96862220d.mp4?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through colorful areas full of hidden food sources, strange plants, and lively wildlife. Gather materials through exploration and mini-games, then return to your lab to experiment with new food combinations. Every discovery brings you closer to unlocking the mysteries of Momolito evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/61eb0f652a4ec8a97c8534eea928c056.poster.avif?t=1776092527\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/61eb0f652a4ec8a97c8534eea928c056.webm?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/61eb0f652a4ec8a97c8534eea928c056.mp4?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your lab, interact with your creatures, and record your findings in your computer log. Complete your collection and become the ultimate Momolito researcher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/a2bfb7a2ef166217d2a5f2271e5ba02c.poster.avif?t=1776092527\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/a2bfb7a2ef166217d2a5f2271e5ba02c.webm?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/a2bfb7a2ef166217d2a5f2271e5ba02c.mp4?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>over 500 possible forms</strong> across multiple evolution paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant zones filled with resources, secrets, and mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and feed adorable Momolitos to influence their evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yet mysterious world inspired by creature-collecting classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your lab, interact with your creatures, and unlock hidden combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing experience perfect for both casual players and collectors alike.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>MomoLAB</strong>, a mysterious facility where adorable creatures known as <strong>Momolitos</strong> are born!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the newest researcher, your mission is to explore different zones, collect ingredients, and feed your Momolitos to help them evolve into hundreds of unique forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/97eb9a81fdcc6b2939b21f4882657ee0.poster.avif?t=1776092527\" width=1170 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/97eb9a81fdcc6b2939b21f4882657ee0.webm?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Momolito starts as a simple egg, but your choices determine its path — will it become a joyful and friendly creature, a fierce and wild one, or something totally unexpected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/41648076d0bf839d799eaae96862220d.poster.avif?t=1776092527\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/41648076d0bf839d799eaae96862220d.webm?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/41648076d0bf839d799eaae96862220d.mp4?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through colorful areas full of hidden food sources, strange plants, and lively wildlife. Gather materials through exploration and mini-games, then return to your lab to experiment with new food combinations. Every discovery brings you closer to unlocking the mysteries of Momolito evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/61eb0f652a4ec8a97c8534eea928c056.poster.avif?t=1776092527\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/61eb0f652a4ec8a97c8534eea928c056.webm?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/61eb0f652a4ec8a97c8534eea928c056.mp4?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your lab, interact with your creatures, and record your findings in your computer log. Complete your collection and become the ultimate Momolito researcher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/a2bfb7a2ef166217d2a5f2271e5ba02c.poster.avif?t=1776092527\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/a2bfb7a2ef166217d2a5f2271e5ba02c.webm?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/extras/a2bfb7a2ef166217d2a5f2271e5ba02c.mp4?t=1776092527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>over 500 possible forms</strong> across multiple evolution paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant zones filled with resources, secrets, and mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and feed adorable Momolitos to influence their evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy yet mysterious world inspired by creature-collecting classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your lab, interact with your creatures, and unlock hidden combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing experience perfect for both casual players and collectors alike.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Explore vibrant zones, collect ingredients, and feed adorable Momolitos to help them evolve into hundreds of unique forms. A cozy creature-collecting adventure that blends exploration, discovery, and the joy of caring for your own lab full of curious life.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Catalan, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/103239774ce07321f4f97634ff3c2f91cbeabc0b/header.jpg?t=1776092527", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/1ce2eea8354c51bf90cc56dd487f731830b598a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776092527", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991200/1ce2eea8354c51bf90cc56dd487f731830b598a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776092527", "website": "https://gocagames.com/momolitos", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\